Bayesian Context Trees source notice
====================================

This directory contains an adaptation of the Bayesian Context Trees C++
implementation by Ioannis Papageorgiou:

  https://github.com/IoannisPapageorgiou/Bayesian-Context-Trees

The related BCT R package by the same author is available from:

  https://cran.r-project.org/package=BCT

The standalone C++ repository does not contain a separate explicit license
notice. Its related CRAN BCT distribution declares `GPL (>= 2)`. On that basis,
CAP applies the following license to the adapted source in this directory and
the resulting `bin/ctw-calc` executable:

  GPL-2.0-or-later

The complete GPL version 2 and version 3 texts are at
`licenses/GPL-2.0.txt` and `licenses/GPL-3.0.txt` in the CAP repository. See
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for provenance, modification, and distribution
details.
